host_about:
@tobyklayman 
Toby is a Fine Artist, Art Professor (retired), Mentor & Author. She has a working Art Studio in San Francisco. She is also an Expert on IP and Managing a Small Business for an Individual Artist.Her current body of work includes plywood hand painted wooden cutout multiples, painted with acrylic as well as a line of hand painted ceramics.
She had a home in Crete, Greece for 25 years.People love to visit her Studio, by appointment!
